  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Sleep Tracker Bar Chart</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Sleep Tracker</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Enter hours slept (0–12) for each day</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"inputs\" aria-label=\"Daily sleep hours\">\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"mon\">Mon</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"mon\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"7\" aria-label=\"Monday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"tue\">Tue</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"tue\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"6.5\" aria-label=\"Tuesday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"wed\">Wed</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"wed\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"8\" aria-label=\"Wednesday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"thu\">Thu</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"thu\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"7.5\" aria-label=\"Thursday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"fri\">Fri</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"fri\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Friday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"sat\">Sat</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"sat\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"9\" aria-label=\"Saturday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"sun\">Sun</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"sun\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"8.5\" aria-label=\"Sunday sleep hours\">\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"chart-section\" aria-label=\"Sleep bar chart\">\n      <div class=\"chart\" id=\"chart\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"summary\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <p>Weekly average: <strong id=\"average\">0.0</strong> hours</p>\n      <p id=\"longest-night\">Longest night: —</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #1e1e2f;\n  --card-bg: #2a2a40;\n  --text: #e0e0f0;\n  --accent: #6c63ff;\n  --accent-hover: #5a52d5;\n  --bar: #4a4a6a;\n  --bar-highlight: #ffb347;\n  --input-bg: #3a3a55;\n  --input-border: #5a5a7a;\n  --focus: #ffb347;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 640px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nheader {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n.inputs {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(70px, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.input-group {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.input-group label {\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n}\n\n.input-group input {\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--input-border);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 8px;\n  width: 100%;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n}\n\n.input-group input:hover {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.input-group input:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--focus);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.3);\n}\n\n.input-group input:active {\n  background: var(--input-border);\n}\n\n.chart-section {\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.chart {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  justify-content: space-around;\n  height: 200px;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 0;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--input-border);\n}\n\n.bar-wrapper {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex: 1;\n  height: 100%;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n\n.bar {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 40px;\n  background: var(--bar);\n  border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;\n  transition: height 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.bar.highlight {\n  background: var(--bar-highlight);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--bar-highlight);\n}\n\n.bar-label {\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n.summary {\n  text-align: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.summary strong {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n#longest-night {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  .inputs {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  }\n  .chart {\n    height: 160px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const days = ['mon', 'tue', 'wed', 'thu', 'fri', 'sat', 'sun'];\nconst dayLabels = ['Mon', 'Tue', 'Wed', 'Thu', 'Fri', 'Sat', 'Sun'];\nconst chart = document.getElementById('chart');\nconst averageEl = document.getElementById('average');\nconst longestEl = document.getElementById('longest-night');\n\nconst inputs = {};\ndays.forEach(id => {\n  inputs[id] = document.getElementById(id);\n});\n\nfunction getValues() {\n  return days.map(id => {\n    const val = parseFloat(inputs[id].value);\n    return isNaN(val) ? 0 : Math.min(12, Math.max(0, val));\n  });\n}\n\nfunction render() {\n  const values = getValues();\n  const maxVal = Math.max(...values);\n  const maxIndex = values.indexOf(maxVal);\n\n  chart.innerHTML = '';\n  values.forEach((val, i) => {\n    const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n    wrapper.className = 'bar-wrapper';\n\n    const bar = document.createElement('div');\n    bar.className = 'bar';\n    if (val === maxVal && maxVal > 0) {\n      bar.classList.add('highlight');\n    }\n    bar.style.height = (val / 12 * 100) + '%';\n    bar.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n\n    const label = document.createElement('span');\n    label.className = 'bar-label';\n    label.textContent = dayLabels[i];\n\n    wrapper.appendChild(bar);\n    wrapper.appendChild(label);\n    chart.appendChild(wrapper);\n  });\n\n  const sum = values.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\n  const avg = sum / 7;\n  averageEl.textContent = avg.toFixed(1);\n\n  if (maxVal > 0) {\n    longestEl.textContent = 'Longest night: ' + dayLabels[maxIndex] + ' (' + maxVal + ' h)';\n  } else {\n    longestEl.textContent = 'Longest night: —';\n  }\n}\n\ndays.forEach(id => {\n  inputs[id].addEventListener('input', render);\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Sleep Tracker Bar Chart\n\nA simple offline browser app to track sleep hours over 7 days. Enter hours slept (0–12) for each day and see a pixel-style bar chart, weekly average, and the longest night highlighted.\n\n## Features\n\n- 7 labeled inputs for daily sleep hours (0–12)\n- Bar chart with heights proportional to values\n- Weekly average displayed to one decimal\n- Longest night highlighted in a distinct color\n- Fully keyboard accessible with visible focus, hover, and pressed states\n- Responsive layout works from 360px wide\n- No external dependencies, network requests, or server code\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Adjust the number inputs to update the chart and summary in real time.\n\n## Technologies\n\n- HTML5\n- CSS3 (flexbox, grid, custom properties)\n- Plain JavaScript (no frameworks or libraries)\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}